WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.747
If you're on the crew, your boss texts you a link,

00:00:04.747 --> 00:00:07.620
tap it, confirm it's you and you're in.

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.140
No password needed.

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:11.786
The Clock tab, your boss already put you on the job,

00:00:11.786 --> 00:00:14.480
so all you have to do is tap clock in.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.760
It also gives you direction to the job.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:20.620
The Schedule tab shows you where you're working and when.

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:24.971
Then the Lists tab, anything your boss wants you to buy or fix

00:00:24.971 --> 00:00:26.620
is right there.

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.530
There's also a group chat with everybody on the job,

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:32.340
that way you can communicate properly.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:35.900
The History tab shows the hours you worked each day.

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:36.980
Need a day off?

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:39.440
Put in a request under Time Off.

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:43.960
When the work's done, add your job photos and end your shift.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:47.002
Your location is stamped once when you clock in and once when

00:00:47.002 --> 00:00:48.320
you clock out.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:49.360
That's all you need to know.
